Package: bulwark-passkey
Version: 0.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: BulwarkID <hello@bulwark.id>
Homepage: https://bulwark.id
Depends: libc6, libgtk-3-0t64 | libgtk-3-0, libwebkit2gtk-4.1-0 | libwebkit2gtk-4.1-0t64
Recommends: usbip | linux-tools-generic, polkitd | policykit-1
Description: Manage and sync passkeys across your devices
 Bulwark Passkey is a virtual FIDO2 authenticator. It exposes a virtual USB
 security key to the system so that websites can register and use passkeys
 that are stored and managed locally by this application.
 .
 Attaching the virtual device needs the usbip userspace tool, the vhci-hcd
 kernel module and pkexec, which are pulled in by the recommended packages.
